  storyText: "The Cage\n\nThe Soulkiller upload starts. Mirage's voice gets smaller and smaller. On a screen you see the file name: PROJECT MIRAGE - WEAPONIZATION VS MILITECH NETWORKS.\n\nThey're not studying her. They're building a weapon.\n\n1. Let it finish.\n2. Rip the cables out."
